#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a <varname>POINT</varname> which is guaranteed to lie in the "
"interior of a surface (<varname>POLYGON</varname>, "
"<varname>MULTIPOLYGON</varname>, and <varname>CURVEPOLYGON</varname>). In "
"PostGIS this function also works on line and point geometries."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en <varname>POINT</varname> som garanterat ligger i det inre av "
"en yta (<varname>POLYGON</varname>, <varname>MULTIPOLYGON</varname> och "
"<varname>CURVEPOLYGON</varname>). I PostGIS fungerar funktionen även för "
"linje- och punktgeometrier."
